      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $A$ below. Which set of entries should be replaced by $0$ to obtain row echelon form **using the fewest replacements**? Leave all other entries unchanged.\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 & 7 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 8 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -7 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -9 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
